# 1. Create Project Folder
mkdir Report-Automation

# 2. Go Inside Folder
cd Report-Automation

# 3. Allow PowerShell For Current Session
Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy Bypass

# 4. Initialize Node Project
npm init -y

# 5. Install Playwright Project
npm init playwright@latest

# 6. Install Browsers
npx playwright install

# 7. Open VS Code
code .

# 8. Run Tests
npx playwright test

# 9. Run In Chrome UI Mode
npx playwright test --headed

# 10. Run In Debug Mode
npx playwright test --debug

# 11. Open HTML Report
npx playwright show-report

# 12. Open Playwright Codegen
npx playwright codegen

# 13. Open Codegen With URL
npx playwright codegen https://admin.rezmate.com

# 14. Install Extra Useful Packages
npm install dotenv
npm install exceljs

# 15. Run Specific Test File
npx playwright test e2e/tests/reservationValidation.spec.ts

# 16. Run Only Chromium
npx playwright test --project=chromium

# 17. Update Playwright
npm install -D @playwright/test@latest

# 18. Reinstall Browsers
npx playwright install --force

---------------------------------------------------------------

Inside that directory, you can run several commands:

  npx playwright test
    Runs the end-to-end tests.

  npx playwright test --ui
    Starts the interactive UI mode.

  npx playwright test --project=chromium
    Runs the tests only on Desktop Chrome.

  npx playwright test example
    Runs the tests in a specific file.

  npx playwright test --debug
    Runs the tests in debug mode.

  npx playwright codegen
    Auto generate tests with Codegen.

We suggest that you begin by typing:

    npx playwright test